Sattar Khadam Se Zainab Bhai Ku Dekhti Hai<br>
Sar Kat Raha Hai Khahar Tadhap rahi Hai<br>
<br>
1.Narga Hai Zalimou Ka Aur Beech Me Hai Sarwar<br>
Jis Simt Dekhti Hai Gurbat Hai Bekasi Hai<br>
<br>
2.Hathou Se Dil Ku Thame Kis Aas-o-Bekasi Se<br>
Maqtal Me Aake Zehra Faryaad Kar Rahi Hai<br>
<br>
3.Allah Re Yeh Gurbat Kisku Pukare Zainab<br>
Gash Me Padhe Hai Abid Bete Hai Na Aaqi Hai<br>
<br>
4.Dariya Pe Soraha Hai Shaane Kaate Ke Gazi<br>
Qasim Hai Aur Na Akber Khaimou Me Khamoshi Hai<br>
<br>
5.Zakhmi Hai Neem Jaan Hai Pyasa Hai Teen Din Ka<br>
Shukr-e-Khuda Zaban Par Houthou Pe Ya Ali Hai<br>
<br>
6.Kyun Qatl Kar Raha Hai Bhai Ku Mere Zalim<br>
Shimre Shaqi Se Zainab Faryaad Kar Rahi Hai<br>
<br>
7.Khahar Ku Apni Sarwar Hasrath Se Dekhti Hai<br>
Sukhe Gaale Pe Khanjar Houthou Pe Tashnagi Hai<br>
<br>
8.Sukhe Gaale Pe Sheh Ke Khanjar Chalaya Zalim<br>
Sar Peeti Hai Zehra Maajayi Gash Howi Hai<br>
<br>
9.Tham Tham Ke Run Me Zalim Kaata Hai Halq-e-Sarwar<br>
Gham Se Falak Hai Kaapa Larza Zameen Howi Hai<br>
<br>
10.Qayam Rahe Jahan Me Yeh Karwan Aza Ka<br>
Binte Ali Ke Lab Par Mehdi Dua Yehin Hai<br>
<br>
11.Mehshar Bapa Hai Mazhar Khaime Me Shahe deen Ke<br>
Mushkil Khusha Ki Beti Mushkil Me Padh Gayi Ha
